        "claim-straight-line-graph-drawings-can-be-rendered-interactively-with-adjustable-level--d4a598a6ca79"
      ],
      "heading": "Topic framing",
      "section_id": "topic_framing",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-01-sphere-tracing-a-geometric-method-for-the-antialiased-ray-tracing-of-implicit-surfaces--eee351440d34",
        "source-02-image-based-crowd-rendering--565ae2b0e3a1",
